It's a handful that includes the Riders, angels, archons, aligned
priests, arch liches, and high priests.

That's essentially everything you care about on Astral, where you're
likely better off with a short sword than Mjollnir.
In the Sanctum there are some demons to worry about too, but a silver
saber will give you good compromise damage (still pretty good vs. the
demons and not nearly as bad against the aligned priests).

Useless is an overstatement (twoweaponing anything will do good
damage), but for the biggest parts of the late game where I'm likely
to care at all about damage there's a decent selection of non-artifact
weapons that outclass Mojo.  YMMV if you tend to do a fair amount of
melee on Air too.


